   "heading": {
    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order is the Medicines (Advertisement and Sale) (Exemption) Order 2023 and comes into operation on 18 December 2023."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H3119-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Definition"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. In this Order, “licensable healthcare service” has the meaning given by section 3(1) of the Healthcare Services Act 2020."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H3119-A3",
   "no": 3,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "3."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Exemption from section 5 of Act"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "3. Section 5 of the Act does not apply in relation to an advertisement published by a person who is licensed under the Healthcare Services Act 2020 to provide any licensable healthcare service."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H3119-A4",
   "no": 4,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "4."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Revocation"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "4. Revoke the Medicines (Advertisement and Sale) (Exemption) Order 2004 (G.N. No. S 280/2004)."
   }
